of where such joy shines on us.

194
00:11:19,660 --> 00:11:21,740
The first one starts with despair.

195
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:25,877
When a desolate situation becomes
hopeful, one starts to feel blessed.

196
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:29,097
The very moment your oversized
weeds snatch me out of the sky,

197
00:11:29,180 --> 00:11:31,897
