close to true fear.

198
00:11:31,980 --> 00:11:34,780
And boy, oh boy, was it
a dreadful sensation.

199
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:37,088
But I cut through the pain.

200
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:40,217
My years of experience
combined with my sheer

201
