from its body, it dies.

238
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,532
All that's left is wood.

239
00:13:56,800 --> 00:14:00,617
And because you destroyed the
branch, it returned to bullet form.

240
00:14:00,700 --> 00:14:04,524
Oh, and before I forget about all
that creepy happiness bullshit?

241
