you like this, It brings me no joy at all.

242
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:10,520
Not a bit, though.

243
00:14:10,740 --> 00:14:14,328
Maybe it's cuz I'm the one who's
been winning this whole time

244
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:26,114
Jeez talk about close you managed to
stop his mold from spreading further

245
