but if you don't mind, scooch a little.

246
00:14:41,980 --> 00:14:44,837
It's possible I'm overthinking
things a bit here.

247
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:49,861
However, I get the feeling that Cioccolata
guy's faking, that he's just playing dead.

248
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:51,350
Hey, dick!

249
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:53,581
No one's gonna buy that lame act!

250
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:56,751
