trench before that stronzo could get to me.

255
00:15:11,100 --> 00:15:12,980
Then I'll disperse more mold.

256
00:15:13,780 --> 00:15:16,898
That's what you're planning
in that sick head, right?

257
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:21,000
Full disclosure, I'm pretty badly injured.

258
00:15:21,260 --> 00:15:23,966
My right lung has suffered
a sizable puncture.

259
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:26,720
My subclavian artery
is completely severed.

260
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:28,337
I've got four cracked ribs,

261
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:31,891
not to mention my humerus and
carpals are pretty much shot.

262
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:37,562
Climbing all the way up there to get to
you would present a challenge, I would say.

263
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:41,757
How lucky for me, then, that my
stand is none other than Golden Wind.

264
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:44,722
It has power in spades
and a range of two meters.

265
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:47,017
That means you fall well within its reach.

266
00:15:47,100 --> 00:15:49,865
It'll only take an instant
for us to crush you.

267
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,038
He's dead, Journal!

268
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:55,653
You already got him right in the noggin!

269
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:56,790
Not quite.

270
00:15:56,873 --> 00:16:00,757
If you can behave when I get
up there then I promise to show

271
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:04,487
you a little mercy and you'll
come out of this with your life.

272
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:06,200
I'm throwing you a rope.

273
00:16:08,060 --> 00:16:13,040
So what'll it be I'm gonna start
making my way to you think hard.

274
00:16:17,020 --> 00:16:21,260
You're getting nowhere near me look
behind you you bungling sucker.

275
00:16:23,740 --> 00:16:26,960
Uh-oh, whose hand is that
on Mista and the turtle?

276
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:30,740
You dumbass!

277
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:33,297
The entire time you were
running your worthless mouth,

278
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:35,677
you didn't even notice my
right arm sneaking toward?

279
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:38,878
your little friends in the
shadows once, now, did ya?

280
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:41,797
Well, Mista's throat will
have to pay the price.

281
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:43,600
Seems you have to choose.

282
00:16:43,780 --> 00:16:47,309
Either you can pursue me, or
you can heal your precious pal.

283
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:50,917
Who's winning now, worthless fool?

284
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,360
Time to die!

285
00:16:56,700 --> 00:16:57,720
You were close.

286
00:16:58,060 --> 00:17:00,942
I drew out my speech in
order to buy myself time.

287
00:17:01,140 --> 00:17:04,557
The bullet that tore a hole through
your head still had to mature,

288
00:17:04,640 --> 00:17:08,111
before eventually making its
way back to the initial wound.

289
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:11,437
The shrapnel that drew it
was lodged in your skull,

290
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:14,226
and returned to its
original form as a beetle.

291
00:17:14,580 --> 00:17:17,117
One whose growth I happened
to accelerate greatly

292
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:20,082
with golden wind when I
aimed for the propellers.

293
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:23,697
I wanted to be certain you
were completely neutralized,

294
00:17:23,780 --> 00:17:27,797
meaning I had to finish you off, whether
or not I could still hear a heartbeat.

295
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:31,400
But, but you said that
if I just stayed still,

296
00:17:31,640 --> 00:17:35,000
that I, I would still
make it out of this alive.

297
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:36,780
Oh, give me a break.

298
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:41,177
If you really thought I was being
serious, then you're the worthless fool.

299
00:17:41,260 --> 00:17:43,180
I don't spare pieces of shit.

300
00:17:44,220 --> 00:17:45,920
What did you just call me?

301
00:17:58,560 --> 00:17:59,960
Silence.

302
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:03,380
Silence.

303
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:07,140
Silence.

304
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:31,717
This is nothing!

305
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:32,630
Journal!

306
00:18:33,460 --> 00:18:35,920
Look who's waking up from his nappy nap!

307
00:18:36,420 --> 00:18:37,820
I hate me, mister!

308
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:39,180
I missed you!

309
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:44,210
What the?

310
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:45,536
How'd that get here?

311
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:46,940
Did Cioccolata drop it?

312
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,080
Don't tell me!

313
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:49,837
Was he on the phone this entire time?

314
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:52,140
I didn't even see it. Damn it.

315
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:53,911
Who the hell did he call?

316
00:18:54,700 --> 00:18:56,300
Come on, come on, pick up!

317
00:18:56,860 --> 00:18:57,690
Cioccolata!

318
00:18:59,940 --> 00:19:01,577
What's the holdup over there?

319
00:19:01,660 --> 00:19:04,240
He doesn't usually take this long. Hello?

320
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:07,110
Huh?

321
00:19:07,193 --> 00:19:08,958
What's this flashing thingamadoodle?

322
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:11,637
Do I press something or...

323
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:13,057
Oh, yeah, that's right.

324
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:15,317
It means I got a message
in my stupid inbox.

325
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:16,230
No frickin' duh.

326
00:19:16,313 --> 00:19:18,520
Now let's see here. Wow, there's two.

327
00:19:18,820 --> 00:19:20,597
And wait, I don't remember him calling me.

328
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:23,680
Was it when I was chasing
Bucciarati earlier today?

329
00:19:24,720 --> 00:19:25,920
Seko, it's me.

330
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:28,480
Chocolata's back!

331
00:19:31,980 --> 00:19:35,740
I took care of that little
twerp with the gun, Mista. Yay!

332
00:19:36,180 --> 00:19:40,657
But that newcomer Giorno looks like he's
trying to come up to the helicopter.

333
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:43,120
The sad fool can climb all he wants.

334
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:44,697
Victory is already mine.

335
00:19:44,780 --> 00:19:46,780
You finish off that Bucciarati.

336
00:19:47,060 --> 00:19:50,060
Do that and I'll give you
the bestest back scratch.

337
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:52,997
And don't think I forgot the sugar cubes.

338
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:54,197
Are you ready, boy?

339
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:55,280
Here they come.

340
00:19:55,620 --> 00:19:56,679
How many you want?

341
00:19:59,180 --> 00:20:00,240
How about two?

342
00:20:05,460 --> 00:20:07,000
All right, you rascal.

343
00:20:07,280 --> 00:20:08,398
I'll give you five.

344
00:20:10,620 --> 00:20:12,080
Oh, I'm winding up.

345
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:13,797
You gotta catch him
with your muzzle, okay?

346
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:15,174
Hey, no hands allowed.

347
00:20:19,120 --> 00:20:20,200
Listen, Seiko.

348
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:23,200
You and I are unstoppable,

349
00:20:23,540 --> 00:20:27,717
and it is the duty of those who are
strong like us to rule over the weak.

350
00:20:27,800 --> 00:20:29,880
One might say we, the mighty,

351
00:20:30,100 --> 00:20:33,747
were charged by the heavens to
guide the frail and the feeble.

352
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:40,245
Even if the boss numbers among them, not
only will I destroy those irksome louts?

353
00:20:40,360 --> 00:20:42,500
I will transcend the boss himself.

354
00:20:43,040 --> 00:20:46,680
And you shall be by my side,
because you are strong.

355
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:49,320
Giorno's here. I must go.

356
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:50,816
Just one more thing.

357
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:54,715
I want you to know that you
are very dear to me, Seiko.

358
00:20:55,460 --> 00:20:56,600
Talk to you soon.

359
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:19,080
That malicious mole should
be far behind by now.

360
00:22:13,213 --> 00:22:16,677
But they dare to tell us
what's bad and what's good.

361
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:20,217
Stand up, join us!

362
00:22:20,300 --> 00:22:23,637
Come on, just see this light!

363
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:28,277
We are the power, who's in the future?

364
00:22:28,360 --> 00:22:34,360
Because we are the fighters,
just fighting for a ride.

365
00:23:42,500 --> 00:23:44,300
Thank you.
